@baseUrl = http://localhost:5147
@token = replace-with-a-valid-access-token

### Get current wallet balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get wallet transaction history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### History pagination is capped at 100 transactions per page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/transactions?page=1&pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
